# Student Personal Info APIs — Walkthrough

## Summary

Implemented 2 student personal info endpoints using an **upsert pattern** — single `PUT` endpoint handles both create and update. Frontend sends data once; backend decides whether to INSERT or UPDATE.

## Files Created & Modified

| Action | File | Purpose |
|--------|------|---------|
| **NEW** | [personal.validator.js](file:///c:/Users/Gopal%20Bharat%20Patil/OneDrive/Desktop/placement-crm-api/src/validators/student/personal.validator.js) | Joi validation — Indian mobile, aadhaar, gender/category enums |
| **NEW** | [personal.service.js](file:///c:/Users/Gopal%20Bharat%20Patil/OneDrive/Desktop/placement-crm-api/src/services/student/personal.service.js) | `INSERT ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE` upsert + `same_as_permanent` auto-copy |
| **NEW** | [personal.controller.js](file:///c:/Users/Gopal%20Bharat%20Patil/OneDrive/Desktop/placement-crm-api/src/controllers/student/personal.controller.js) | API_START/END logging, 201 for new / 200 for update |
| **NEW** | [personal.routes.js](file:///c:/Users/Gopal%20Bharat%20Patil/OneDrive/Desktop/placement-crm-api/src/routes/student/personal.routes.js) | PUT + GET with authenticate |
