## Postman Test Data

### 1. `PUT /api/student/save_personal_info` (First time — creates)

**Cookie:** `token=<jwt_from_login>`

```json
{
  "mobile_number": "9876543210",
  "alternate_mobile": "9876543211",
  "birth_date": "2003-06-15",
  "gender": "Male",
  "blood_group": "O+",
  "aadhaar_number": "123456789012",
  "caste": "Maratha",
  "category": "OBC",
  "nationality": "Indian",
  "father_name": "Rajesh Sharma",
  "father_mobile": "9876543200",
  "father_occupation": "Business",
  "father_annual_income": 500000,
  "mother_name": "Sunita Sharma",
  "mother_mobile": "9876543201",
  "mother_occupation": "Homemaker",
  "mother_annual_income": 0,
  "guardian_name": "Rajesh Sharma",
  "guardian_mobile": "9876543200",
  "permanent_address": "123, MG Road, Shivaji Nagar",
  "permanent_city": "Pune",
  "permanent_district": "Pune",
  "permanent_state": "Maharashtra",
  "permanent_pincode": "411001",
  "same_as_permanent": true
}
```
**Response:** `201 Created` with full personal info data.

> [!TIP]
> When `same_as_permanent: true`, current address is auto-copied from permanent address. You don't need to send current address fields.

### 2. `PUT /api/student/save_personal_info` (Second time — updates)

Send **only the fields you want to change**:
```json
{
  "mobile_number": "9123456789",
  "blood_group": "A+",
  "same_as_permanent": false,
  "current_address": "456, FC Road, Deccan",
  "current_city": "Pune",
  "current_district": "Pune",
  "current_state": "Maharashtra",
  "current_pincode": "411004"
}
```
**Response:** `200 OK` with updated personal info data.

### 3. `GET /api/student/get_personal_info`

**Cookie:** `token=<jwt_from_login>` — No body needed.

**Response:** Full personal info object, or `null` with message if not yet filled.

---

## Updatable Fields Reference

| Group | Fields |
|-------|--------|
| Contact | `mobile_number`, `alternate_mobile` |
| Personal | `birth_date`, `gender`, `blood_group`, `aadhaar_number`, `caste`, `category`, `nationality` |
| Father | `father_name`, `father_mobile`, `father_occupation`, `father_annual_income` |
| Mother | `mother_name`, `mother_mobile`, `mother_occupation`, `mother_annual_income` |
| Guardian | `guardian_name`, `guardian_mobile` |
| Address | `permanent_address/city/district/state/pincode`, `current_address/city/district/state/pincode`, `same_as_permanent` |

## Valid Enum Values

| Field | Valid Values |
|-------|-------------|
| `gender` | `Male`, `Female`, `Other`, `Prefer not to say` |
| `category` | `General`, `OBC`, `SC`, `ST`, `NT`, `VJ`, `SBC` |
| `blood_group` | `A+`, `A-`, `B+`, `B-`, `AB+`, `AB-`, `O+`, `O-` |
